mind/dum-e-qwen3-merged/

# Superseded documentation. explain.txt described an ESP32/Arduino firmware
# layer that never existed in this repository; the root README.md now covers
# the real architecture and flags the stale sub-docs.
explain.txt

# Runtime state written by the app on every run. Machine-specific, not source.
mind/robot_state.json
mind/robot_command.json
robot_state.json
robot_command.json

